{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Soulglass",
    "steam_appid": 3504430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your contract is to protect unknown souls, each embodied in a Soulglass. Keep the sands of this giant mystical hourglass flowing while fending off afflictions that threaten both you and your charge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting abilities that allow you to play with movement and physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of strategic variety based on your ability choices.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse levels with colorful environments and obstacles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504430/extras/7ba18c8d4d85d8d429ae3c604d596a6f.poster.avif?t=1752170771\" width=282 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504430/extras/7ba18c8d4d85d8d429ae3c604d596a6f.webm?t=1752170771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504430/extras/7ba18c8d4d85d8d429ae3c604d596a6f.mp4?t=1752170771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504430/extras/db3177ecb761978a14683035d53294fc.poster.avif?t=1752170771\" width=282 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504430/extras/db3177ecb761978a14683035d53294fc.webm?t=1752170771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504430/extras/db3177ecb761978a14683035d53294fc.mp4?t=1752170771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERCOME ADVERSITY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Afflictions create physical challenges for you, while the soul you protect carries even heavier burdens. Their story is shaped by the Soulglass\u2019s traits and active afflictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAINTAIN BALANCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your abilities to navigate the Soulglass and remove afflictions that attach to its surface. Keep the sand flowing in order to complete your contract while avoiding total imbalance where any chamber of the Soulglass becomes completely empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAIN POWER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing contracts grants opportunities to upgrade your abilities. Plan wisely, as future challenges will test you in three key areas:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control over objects and the Soulglass itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed and precision in navigating the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strength against afflictions and obstacles</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your contract is to protect unknown souls, each embodied in a Soulglass. Keep the sands of this giant mystical hourglass flowing while fending off afflictions that threaten both you and your charge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting abilities that allow you to play with movement and physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of strategic variety based on your ability choices.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse levels with colorful environments and obstacles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504430/extras/7ba18c8d4d85d8d429ae3c604d596a6f.poster.avif?t=1752170771\" width=282 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504430/extras/7ba18c8d4d85d8d429ae3c604d596a6f.webm?t=1752170771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504430/extras/7ba18c8d4d85d8d429ae3c604d596a6f.mp4?t=1752170771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504430/extras/db3177ecb761978a14683035d53294fc.poster.avif?t=1752170771\" width=282 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504430/extras/db3177ecb761978a14683035d53294fc.webm?t=1752170771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504430/extras/db3177ecb761978a14683035d53294fc.mp4?t=1752170771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERCOME ADVERSITY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Afflictions create physical challenges for you, while the soul you protect carries even heavier burdens. Their story is shaped by the Soulglass\u2019s traits and active afflictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAINTAIN BALANCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your abilities to navigate the Soulglass and remove afflictions that attach to its surface. Keep the sand flowing in order to complete your contract while avoiding total imbalance where any chamber of the Soulglass becomes completely empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAIN POWER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing contracts grants opportunities to upgrade your abilities. Plan wisely, as future challenges will test you in three key areas:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control over objects and the Soulglass itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed and precision in navigating the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strength against afflictions and obstacles</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Soulglass is a chill physics-based roguelite where you push a giant mystical hourglass to keep the sand flowing while managing afflictions that alter physics and create obstacles.",
